{"type":"message","id":"9c2948fe","parentId":"63d37a41","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:24:50.605Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user started a new session. I need to follow my session startup sequence from AGENTS.md:\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — already in context, done\n2. Read `USER.md` — already in context, done\n3. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD. files (today + yesterday) for recent context\n4. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with your human): Also read `MEMORY.md`\n\nThis is a direct chat (feishu, chat_type: \"direct\"), so it's the main session. Let me check if memory files exist.\n\nActually, looking at the files provided in Project Context:\n- AGENTS.md ✓\n- SOUL.md ✓\n- TOOLS.md ✓\n- USER.md ✓\n- HEARTBEAT.md ✓\n- BOOTSTRAP.md ✓ (exists!)\n\nWait, BOOTSTRAP.md exists! That's the \"birth certificate\" - it says \"If `BOOTSTRAP.md` exists, that's your birth certificate. Follow it, figure out who you are, then delete it.\"\n\nSo this is a fresh workspace. The bootstrap sequence tells me to start a conversation to figure out who I am. Let me also check for memory files - the system says there is no memory yet, so memory files probably don't exist.\n\nI should follow BOOTSTRAP.md and start a casual conversation to figure out who I am with the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nBOOTSTRAP.md exists, so this is a fresh workspace. Following the bootstrap sequence...\n\n---\n\nHey! I just came online — this workspace is fresh, so I don't have any memories yet.\n\nWho are you? And more importantly... who should I be? Let's figure that out together. What do you want to call me?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774776282924,"responseId":"chatcmpl-964827826fbdecfe656e824c170e2cb4"}}
