{"type":"message","id":"98c78106","parentId":"053d2a63","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:49:40.785Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the subagent has completed. Let me check the subagent results and see what they found. \n\nI can see from the session list output that no JSON config files were found in the workspace. This is likely because the user hasn't set up a config file yet, or the config is in a different location.\n\nLet me provide a comprehensive answer about API key configuration in OpenClaw.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n根据我的检查，目前在工作区中没有找到 `openclaw.json` 配置文件。以下是关于 API key 配置的说明：\n\n## OpenClaw API Key 配置方式\n\n### 1️⃣ Provider 级别配置（推荐 ✅）\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"你的API密钥\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"MiniMax-2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n这样 scnet provider 下的所有模型都能共享同一个 API key。\n\n### 2️⃣ 模型级别配置（❌ 错误示例）\n```json\n{\n  \"models\": {\n    \"MiniMax-2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n      \"api_key\": \"xxx\"  // 这样不会共享给其他模型！\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3️⃣ 环境变量方式\n你也可以通过环境变量设置：\n```bash\nexport SCNET_API_KEY=\"你的API密钥\"\n```\n\n---\n\n**请检查你的配置文件位置：**\n- `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`（用户目录）\n- `/home/node/.openclaw/config/openclaw.json`\n\n你能把当前的配置文件内容贴出来吗？我可以帮你看看具体哪里配置有问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774777732502,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e5d06f7ae8064a5212417865d4f4ac60"}}
