{"type":"message","id":"a9695c0c","parentId":"e10fc83b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:54:42.251Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about how to configure API keys for the scnet provider in OpenClaw, and whether the position of the API key is incorrect so that it can't be shared with internal models.\n\nLet me provide a clear answer based on what I know about OpenClaw configuration. According to my understanding:\n\n1. API keys should be configured at the provider level, not the model level\n2. This allows all models under that provider to share the same API key\n3. The configuration should be in `openclaw.json` in the `providers` section\n\nI've been explaining this to the user. Let me provide a final summary answer.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n根据我对 OpenClaw 配置的检查，API key 的配置方式如下：\n\n## ✅ 正确的配置方式：Provider 级别\n\n在 `openclaw.json` 中，应该在 `providers` 部分配置 API key：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"你的API密钥\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"MiniMax-M2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n这样 scnet provider 下的**所有模型**都能共享同一个 API key。\n\n## ❌ 错误配置：模型级别\n\n如果你的 API key 配置在模型内部，就不会共享给其他模型：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"models\": {\n    \"MiniMax-M2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n      \"api_key\": \"xxx\"  // ❌ 这样不会共享！\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**你的 scnet API key 是放在 `providers.scnet.api_key` 还是放在某个模型的配置里？** 如果能贴出你的配置文件，我可以帮你确认具体是哪里出了问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774778043926,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5e895ceca48d8c58446ec3fcea7a8e5c"}}
