{"type":"message","id":"0644c5ae","parentId":"25717c07","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:59:54.228Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the config. Let me check the content:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"default_model\": \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\",\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"sk-xxx\"\n    },\n    \"openrouter\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"sk-or-xxx\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"plugins\": {\n    ...\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"scnet/MiniMax-2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"openrouter/google/gemini-2.0-flash\": {\n      \"provider\": \"openrouter\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSo the user has configured the API key at the provider level correctly:\n- `providers.scnet.api_key` is set to \"sk-xxx\"\n\nAnd models reference the provider:\n- `\"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": { \"provider\": \"scnet\" }`\n- `\"scnet/MiniMax-2.5\": { \"provider\": \"scnet\" }`\n\nThis is actually the correct configuration! The API key is at the provider level and should be shared across all scnet models.\n\nThe user mentioned \"scnet internal models can't share API key\" - maybe they're referring to something else? Or maybe they haven't reloaded the config?\n\nActually wait - I see the user's config is already correct. The API key is in `providers.scnet.api_key`, which should allow all scnet models to use it. \n\nMaybe the issue is something else - perhaps the config wasn't reloaded? Or maybe there's an issue with how scnet provider works internally?\n\nLet me respond to the user explaining that their current config looks correct, and ask if they're still experiencing issues.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully, the config looks correct. The API key is at the provider level under `providers.scnet.api_key`, and both models (`scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2` and `scnet/MiniMax-2.5`) reference `scnet` as their provider. This should work. I should let the user know their configuration appears correct and ask if they're still running into problems, or if maybe the config needs to be reloaded.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n找到了你的配置文件！让我检查一下：\n\n**你当前的配置看起来是正确的：**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"sk-xxx\"  // ✅ API key 在 provider 级别\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"  // ✅ 引用 scnet provider\n    },\n    \"scnet/MiniMax-2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"  // ✅ 引用 scnet provider\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n你的 API key 已经放在 `providers.scnet.api_key` 位置，这是正确的！scnet 下的所有模型（如 DeepSeek-V3.2、MiniMax-2.5）都应该能共享这个 API key。\n\n**如果还是无法共享，可能是以下原因：**\n1. 配置文件没有重新加载（需要重启 OpenClaw 服务）\n2. scnet provider 本身的问题\n\n你需要我帮你检查其他问题吗？或者你可以尝试运行 `openclaw gateway restart` 重载配置试试。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774778353852,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5939f344074c14f5e22d59b2499f324b"}}
