{"type":"message","id":"026de855","parentId":"f966fcb0","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:04:39.603Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The subagent completed. But I still can't get the actual content of the file. The results from subagents are being truncated or I can't access them properly.\n\nLet me just provide the user with a clear answer based on what I know, and ask them to share their config. I've been spending too much time trying to read the config file through subagents.","thinkingSignature":"93e5693bdf5a87cf8406fa230f7094def8100fceb930cd51a56c8d6f24bfa463"},{"type":"text","text":"我无法通过子代理读取配置文件内容。能否直接把 `openclaw.json` 中 `providers` 和 `models` 部分的配置贴给我？（遮蔽 API key）\n\n根据 OpenClaw 的标准配置方式：\n\n**✅ 正确方式 — API key 在 provider 级别（可共享）**\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"你的密钥\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/MiniMax-M2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**❌ 错误方式 — API key 在模型级别（不共享）**\n```json\n{\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/MiniMax-M2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n      \"api_key\": \"xxx\"  // 这样其他模型用不了\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n你的 scnet API key 是放在 `providers.scnet.api_key` 还是放在模型配置里面？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":95622,"output":309,"cacheRead":8097,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104028,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774778663029,"responseId":"06182c27feed5d051358c627be57dd02"}}
