{"type":"message","id":"8dc7acf9","parentId":"08024642","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:05:49.482Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The subagent b91abb99 completed. It was trying to read the openclaw.json file with python. Let me check if it got the content. I still can't directly see the output of the subagent in my context - I need to access its transcript. But actually I realize I should just respond to the user now.\n\nThe issue is I keep spawning subagents but I can't see their output because the results get truncated in the session history. The user is asking a technical question and I should just answer it based on my knowledge of OpenClaw configuration.\n\nActually, wait - I did see some output earlier from a subagent. Let me think about what I know:\n\nFrom my earlier search, I found that the config file exists at `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/openclaw.json`. Based on the session list entries I saw earlier, I noticed things like:\n\n\n- `model: \"MiniMax-M2.5\"` - This suggests the model configuration\n- `provider: \"scnet\"` - This suggests the scnet provider\n\nBut I don't have the actual full config content.\n\nI think the user is confused about API key placement. Let me just explain it clearly based on OpenClaw's standard configuration approach. I should note that I'm having trouble reading the config file directly, so I should ask the user to paste it themselves. Though I'm also wondering if there's a much simpler solution - maybe the user just needs to restart the OpenClaw gateway to pick up the configuration changes.","thinkingSignature":"991dfc0efc63ffb34821b70441e4cfaf522f42790a4f57fa15190e07c5d5675b"},{"type":"text","text":"我无法直接读取配置文件内容（子代理输出被截断）。能否请你直接把 `openclaw.json` 中的 `providers` 和 `models` 部分贴出来？\n\n不过，根据 OpenClaw 的标准配置逻辑，我可以直接告诉你：\n\n**scnet API key 的正确放置方式 — 在 `providers` 级别：**\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"你的scnet密钥\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/MiniMax-2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n这样 scnet 下的**所有模型都会共享同一个 API key**。\n\n---\n\n另外，**配置修改后需要重载**：\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n你可以先把配置贴出来，我帮你确认具体哪里有问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":104133,"output":506,"cacheRead":8097,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112736,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774778729391,"responseId":"06182c69bdf7f7c3c3bfa2235b25f169"}}
