{"type":"message","id":"886b2490","parentId":"dc8331ea","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:06:32.198Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me just respond to the user with the answer based on what I know, since I keep having issues reading the config file through subagents.","thinkingSignature":"21f75532ce4aa2c600875a024dba5200c40d7514004c405daa558a2f9526ed37"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n我找到你的配置文件在 `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/openclaw.json`，但无法直接读取内容（子代理输出被截断）。\n\n能否直接把 `providers` 和 `models` 部分贴给我？或者告诉我：\n\n1. 你的 API key 是放在 `providers.scnet.api_key` 还是在某个模型配置里面？\n2. 遇到的具体错误是什么？\n\n---\n\n**如果你的配置是这样（API key 在 provider 级别），就是正确的：**\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": { \"api_key\": \"xxx\" }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": { \"provider\": \"scnet\" }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**如果是这样（API key 在模型级别），就不会共享：**\n```json\n{\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n      \"api_key\": \"xxx\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n你的属于哪种情况？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":252,"cacheRead":112781,"cacheWrite":2369,"totalTokens":115412,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774778780202,"responseId":"06182c9cf601cf46b6d64646fb0c04ba"}}
