{"type":"message","id":"48932918","parentId":"74621885","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:08:02.408Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me just give a clear, direct answer to the user's question without spawning more subagents. The user is asking about where to place API keys for scnet in OpenClaw.","thinkingSignature":"f0c21f68f451a9b2084dd96a6acb427c480a73ca69832e3d860d7aad2a35f2f3"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n无法读取配置文件内容，但我可以直接告诉你答案：\n\n## 总结\n\n**你的 `openclaw.json` 应该这样配置，API key 才能共享：**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"你的scnet密钥\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"scnet/MiniMax-2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**核心原则：**\n- `api_key` 放在 `providers.scnet` 级别（可共享给所有 scnet 下的模型）\n- 模型配置里只写 `\"provider\": \"scnet\"`，不要放 api_key\n\n---\n\n能否直接把你配置文件的 `providers` 和 `models` 部分贴出来？这样我能准确判断哪里有问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":234,"cacheRead":120960,"cacheWrite":3015,"totalTokens":124219,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774778869283,"responseId":"06182cf66c9337433837270e93282a9d"}}
