{"type":"message","id":"cb2e3b27","parentId":"2999db88","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:11:11.033Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The system is asking me to continue. But I was doing a memory flush, and I should have already written the memory. Let me check if the memory was written successfully and then continue with the conversation.\n\nActually, looking at my previous actions, I tried to write to memory/2026-03-29.md but I'm not sure if it succeeded because the subagent results weren't visible to me. Let me just continue - if the memory write failed, that's okay, I'll note the key information from the session.\n\nThe user's original question was about OpenClaw scnet API key configuration - whether the API key was in the wrong position preventing sharing with internal models.\n\nI explained the correct configuration structure:\n- API key should be at `providers.scnet.api_key` level for sharing\n- NOT at model level\n\nI asked the user to paste their config but they never did. Let me continue responding to the user's question.","thinkingSignature":"eef9674fa5d4c9c3a47e0e28111dd46aff091c5eafb04dd6cac43b5d627765e0"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n我之前关于 API key 配置问题的回答已经发出去了。核心要点是：\n\n**API key 必须放在 `providers.scnet.api_key` 级别，才能共享给 scnet 下的所有模型。**\n\n你能否把你 `openclaw.json` 中的 `providers` 和 `models` 部分贴出来？这样我能准确判断配置是否正确。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":263,"cacheRead":8097,"cacheWrite":133586,"totalTokens":141956,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774779059034,"responseId":"06182db363320df07c3786189fcb7e40"}}
