{"type":"message","id":"c57018f5","parentId":"c6ad8633","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:11:25.464Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to continue. I've been trying to help them understand the API key configuration but couldn't read the actual config file. Let me provide a clear, concise final answer and ask them to share their config.","thinkingSignature":"5e7e03769589b655d4a1c6ab2de7592e5235b19bec7b6899a44d9ecd4488331b"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n已尝试多次读取配置文件但子代理输出被截断。直接告诉你答案：\n\n## 核心原则\n\n**API key 放在 `providers` 级别 = 可共享 ✅**\n**API key 放在模型级别 = 不共享 ❌**\n\n```json\n// ✅ 正确方式\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": { \"api_key\": \"xxx\" }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": { \"provider\": \"scnet\" }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n把你 `openclaw.json` 的 `providers` 和 `models` 部分贴出来，我帮你看。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":185,"cacheRead":8097,"cacheWrite":132325,"totalTokens":140617,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774779073922,"responseId":"06182dc25892922231358d8a892b39e6"}}
