{"type":"message","id":"e7311661","parentId":"1d15d58a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T10:11:35.939Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to continue. I've been trying to help them with their OpenClaw API key configuration question. Let me provide a clear, final response since I've been struggling with subagent issues.","thinkingSignature":"ffd0c77d75043990b58405a9efacabba8824c131afafe4aac0738723b51a4fbc"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n一直在尝试读取你的配置文件但子代理输出被截断。没关系，我直接给你答案：\n\n## 结论\n\n**scnet API key 必须放在 `providers.scnet.api_key` 级别，才能共享给所有 scnet 下的模型。**\n\n### ✅ 正确配置\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"api_key\": \"你的scnet密钥\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    },\n    \"scnet/MiniMax-2.5\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ 错误配置\n```json\n{\n  \"models\": {\n    \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\": {\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n      \"api_key\": \"xxx\"  // ← 放在模型级别，其他模型用不了\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**把你的 `providers` 和 `models` 部分贴出来，我帮你确认哪里有问题。**"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":274,"cacheRead":140591,"cacheWrite":44,"totalTokens":140919,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774779088390,"responseId":"06182dd0e62f8a400d762c397f9ead66"}}
