{"type":"message","id":"50f61f2e","parentId":"1778de86","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:20:57.747Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to not use subagents. They're frustrated because all my attempts to read the document through subagents have failed due to output truncation.\n\nLet me try to read the file directly without using subagents. I can use the `read` tool to read files directly if they're in the workspace, or I can ask the user to provide the content directly.\n\nActually, the issue is that the docx file is in /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ which is not my workspace. The `read` tool might not be able to read it directly. \n\nLet me think about what tools I have available:\n1. sessions_list - for listing sessions\n2. sessions_history - for fetching history\n3. sessions_send - for sending messages to other sessions\n4. sessions_spawn - for spawning subagents\n\nI don't have a direct `exec` or `read` tool in my available tools. The user is asking me to not use subagents, but those are my only way to interact with the file system.\n\nWait, actually - looking at the tools available, I don't see a direct exec or read tool. The subagents are how I execute commands. But the user is asking me not to use them.\n\nLet me ask the user to paste the content directly, since that's the only option left.","thinkingSignature":"011ce71bdeb96583b4d8cc2bc55a1a0edf14114fff3525bf7796a2992be834e0"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] \n\n明白，但我的工具里只有子代理能读取文件。文档在 `/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/` 目录，不在我的工作区内。\n\n**最简单的方法是你直接复制文档内容贴过来**，我马上帮你总结。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":10,"output":326,"cacheRead":102541,"cacheWrite":7837,"totalTokens":110714,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774786842312,"responseId":"06184c1bb182646e47babe553d775187"}}
