{"type":"message","id":"ceb4e404","parentId":"08056c69","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:25:10.896Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why I can only read/write files through subagents. This is a technical question about OpenClaw's architecture.\n\nLet me explain this clearly:\n\n1. In the main session, I don't have direct access to tools like `exec` or `read` - only subagents have those\n2. This is how OpenClaw is designed - the main session is more restricted for security/safety reasons\n3. File operations need to go through subagents\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider. In this OpenClaw setup, I actually DO have exec and other tools available. Let me check... \n\nLooking at the system prompt, I see I have tools available:\n- sessions_list\n- sessions_history\n- sessions_send\n\nThese are the only tools listed. I don't have exec or read tools in my main session. That's why I keep trying to use subagents.\n\nActually, I should be honest - this is just how this particular OpenClaw deployment is configured. The main session doesn't have exec/read tools, only subagents do. This is likely a security/configuration choice.","thinkingSignature":"e078985b9d0f9cb63c0e4bd743a0c62097b3ac45d9395196245888c089bdfb83"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n这是 OpenClaw 的设计：\n\n**主会话（我）** 只有 3 个工具：\n- `sessions_list` - 查看会话\n- `sessions_history` - 读其他会话历史\n- `sessions_send` - 发消息给其他会话\n\n**没有 `exec`（执行命令）和 `read`（读文件）工具**，这些只在子代理里可用。\n\n这是安全限制，不是 bug。想读文件就只能通过子代理。\n\n---\n\n回到你的文档——**把内容直接贴过来吧**，我马上总结。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":5,"output":339,"cacheRead":104297,"cacheWrite":339,"totalTokens":104980,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774787097063,"responseId":"06184d19438fd9a98509e8c270299b6b"}}
