{"type":"message","id":"99c6cacb","parentId":"35d583ea","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:40:46.932Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they didn't allow building subagents. But I was able to spawn subagents... Wait, maybe they're talking about a different configuration. Maybe they're referring to some other setting, like the ability for subagents to deliver results back to the main session?\n\nActually, I think the user might be confused. I've been successfully spawning subagents throughout this conversation. The issue is that the subagent outputs are getting truncated - meaning the results from the subagents don't come back to me properly. This is different from not being able to spawn subagents.\n\nMaybe they're referring to some kind of \"child session\" or \"subagent delivery\" configuration that controls whether subagent results can be pushed back to the parent session. Let me ask for clarification.","thinkingSignature":"15bac02e94e3ac08d7830beacc393193fc5e94c5e04ea46c6fe62fec75b6c4c9"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n等等，我能构建子代理（你看整个对话里我一直在创建子代理），问题是子代理的输出返回给我时被截断了。\n\n你是说你的配置里有什么选项控制子代理能否返回结果吗？能具体说说是什么配置吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":38,"output":207,"cacheRead":134723,"cacheWrite":47,"totalTokens":135015,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774788038624,"responseId":"061850c7f0824920a8ce2ca0ba29a9ab"}}
