{"type":"compaction","id":"cf53ad5c","parentId":"6363ec1b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T12:46:24.415Z","summary":"\n\n## Goal\n- Read the Feishu document \"ECHO合约接口.docx\" (file_key: file_v3_00_20293284-78_83-4c19-abfa-1f6bed0d41ix) shared by the user\n- Extract its content to understand and help with the ECHO contract interface design\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- User wants to share a Feishu document for review\n- All subagent outputs are getting truncated, preventing direct content reading\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Received the Feishu document attachment with file_key and file_name\n- [x] Attempted to read feishu-doc skill to understand API usage\n- [x] Tried multiple approaches: python-docx, openclaw CLI, feishu_doc command\n- [x] Identified the file is at `/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/ECHOå_çº_æ_å---0...docx`\n- [x] Asked user to paste content directly (since all methods failed due to truncation)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Reading the Feishu document content (blocked by truncated outputs)\n\n### Blocked\n- Subagent results always get truncated, cannot see actual file content\n- Feishu API calls via subagent also produce truncated outputs\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Direct request for content**: Since all programmatic approaches fail due to output truncation, asked user to paste the document content directly\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Wait for user to paste the document content directly into chat\n2. Once content is available, analyze and provide feedback on ECHO contract interface\n\n## Critical Context\n- File: `ECHO合约接口.docx` (Feishu document)\n- File_key: `file_v3_00_20293284-78_83-4c19-abfa-1f6bed0d41ix`\n- Local path attempt: `/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/`\n- The previous summary about OpenClaw scnet API key configuration is no longer relevant - this is a new task about reading a shared Feishu document\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n\n\n## Original Request\nThe user is being asked to deliver a completed subagent task result to the end